<cl=A2A2A2>

The most controversial guild for the uninitiated is the Masters of Steel.
The Eastern philosophy of the spirit and the training in which Masters acquire
fantastic agility - these are the main occupations in the guild. Members of this
guilds are not as militant as other guilds that reject magic,
but in a critical situation, they are capable of inflicting enormous damage to the enemy.,
using secret skills - Whirlwind of Steel and Divine Wind. However,
Masters of Steel do not attack in vain, preferring the defense in which they
we have achieved perfection. Even without armor, they are able to protect themselves
both from magical and combat attacks, and using the secret of the Guild -
Kamae's protective state, they become practically invulnerable.
